  "changes": [
    "Adds Gemini3.5 FlashLite, Gemma4 free and Nemotron3.5 free alongside existing Qwen3.8/Groq, preserving OpenAI and offline rules.",
    "Uses fixed HTTPS/model routes, zero OpenRouter price ceilings prompt/completion/request, no redirects/retries/fallback models, bounded2048-token request and65KiB response, explicit preview/Apply with existing source/access guards.",
    "Separate Google/OpenRouter AES-GCM Keystore namespaces/AAD excluded from backup, shared OpenRouter credential only between its two models; existing OpenAI/Groq credentials/model unchanged.",
    "Adds11 offline contracts; opaque320dp NativeCanvas form proof; corrects old tag test helper to await finite tag jobs rather than racing permanent autosave."
  ],
  "known_limitations": [
    "No real inference calls or physical phone installation.",
    "Groq/Gemini free tiers depend on the user account/project and quotas; Gemini UI requires a project without billing. App cannot verify account pricing.",
    "OpenRouter free models share the service quota; availability can change.",
    "Native UI regression uses Android API28 emulator; not GPU/battery/physical-device performance proof."
  ],
